# KL Sync (kl-sync) v2.4.0

## Project Context
- Framework: Next.js 16 (App Router, Turbopack, React 19)
- Language: TypeScript 5.8 (strict mode)
- Styling: Tailwind CSS v4 + Vanilla CSS tokens in globals.css
- Icons: Native zero-runtime SVG library at src/components/ui/icons.tsx (57 primitives)
- Testing: Native Node.js Test Runner (node:test)
- Architecture: Stateless edge proxy, no database, AES-256-GCM session encryption
- Deployment: Vercel serverless edge functions
- License: Proprietary source-available (NOT MIT)
- Key Principle: Ponytail Philosophy (YAGNI, zero bloat, stdlib > deps, deletion > addition)

## Code Style Constraints
- Strict TypeScript: No `any` (prefer `unknown`).
- Styling: Tailwind CSS v4 only. No inline styles, no CSS-in-JS.
- Exports: No default exports for non-page components.
- Naming: kebab-case for files, PascalCase for components, camelCase for functions.
- Accessibility: WCAG 2.2 AAA (contrast >= 7.1:1, touch targets >= 44px).
- Logging: No `console.log` in production; use error boundaries.

## Banned Libraries (DO NOT SUGGEST OR IMPORT)
lucide-react, heroicons, react-icons, swr, tanstack-query, clsx, classnames, tailwind-merge, framer-motion, motion, axios, lodash, underscore, moment, dayjs, date-fns, jest, vitest, mocha, crypto-js, bcrypt, express, fastify, prisma, drizzle, mongoose

## Architecture Rules
- Stateless proxy: No database, no ORM.
- Session: AES-256-GCM encrypted cookies (use encodeSession/decodeSession).
- Endpoints: src/app/api/ are edge proxy routes. Validate SSRF origins.
- Scrapers: src/lib/scrapers/ using Cheerio.
- UI: src/app/dashboard/ modules are client components.

## Testing Requirements
- Use ONLY native node:test runner. No Jest or Vitest.
- Pre-commit checklist: `npx tsc --noEmit`, `npm run lint`, `npm test`, `npm run build`.

## Common Patterns & Conventions
- Icons: Always import from `@/components/ui/icons`. Never add an icon library.
- Commits: Conventional commits (feat:, fix:, chore:, etc.).

## File Structure Reference
- `src/app/api/` - Edge routes
- `src/app/dashboard/` - Dashboard client components
- `src/components/ui/` - UI elements
- `src/lib/scrapers/` - Cheerio data scrapers
